Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), perl (>= 5.40)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/permittivity2/homelab

Package: homelab-nginx-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: prometheus-nginx-exporter, nginx
Recommends: homelab-agent, homelab-node-exporter, homelab-webproxy
Description: nginx (web proxy) metrics exporter wiring for homelab-*
 Wraps the Ubuntu-archive prometheus-nginx-exporter on the web-proxy/edge
 host. Ships an internal-only nginx stub_status endpoint (loopback
 127.0.0.1:8099), points the exporter at it, and advertises the exporter
 (kind: metrics-exporter, :9113) so homelab-prometheus discovers + scrapes
 nginx connection/request metrics. Install on the homelab-webproxy host.
